nal muscular atrophy (SMA).</p><p>Jesy Nelson: Life Changing starts with a clip from the last time viewers saw Nelson as she relocated to Cornwall with the father of her twins, her fiance Zion Foster, last year. â€œWhen they start walking, they can walk on the sand,â€ a smiling Nelson tells Foster as they sit with their babies on the beach. Of course, anyone who has seen <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/society/2026/jan/04/little-mix-jesy-nelson-twin-babies-may-never-walk">the headlines in recent months</a> knows this is achingly foreboding; a lost future that must be grieved and reshaped.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2026/jul/17/jesy-nelson-life-changing-review-prime-video">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Cp22flXXjiCJcqzqEDHW2KgSyDchiCb-LIkPJXevFBYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;LB_YyZgl6A8mn8of3VdSAwScOsPTXFj-0pg6RbxXLncƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Y3IUrO5-r7OL7-92jZGS8YyudpG5-qHglC339-S6cDwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;sBctKXKnjgoYnOBfrizjl0ZYxDGTicMXGEy0J_Hkna4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pS6Rvdmkhffj35xwyLRuTBKLIbn-V6VQxei455vIXzAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0Grspe2no_2ve3rGIPEKMzrYQoCLmckgmbIySjhoD0Uƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;08GK4lOomdeiAW8ArQz4-q4eh4Z_HknFqLOAuZ0E8mUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;k